  "classification": {
    "rootCause": "code-bug",
    "summary": "NblNftStake.withdrawNft() returned the staked ERC-721 with safeTransferFrom before clearing the slot's NBL accounting and carried no reentrancy guard, so the onERC721Received callback re-entered depositNft/depositNbl and withdrew the contract's whole NBL balance."
  },
